  "content": "<a href=\"https://billing.sparkedhost.com/aff.php?aff=3266\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6pLLiYf.png\"></a>\n<h2><strong>Wall-Jump TXF 模组</strong></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wall-jump-txf\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/full_909143_downloads.svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"CurseForge 下载量\" /></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/wall-jump-txf\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/dynamic/json?color=2d2d2d&amp;colorA=17b85a&amp;style=flat-square&amp;label=&amp;suffix= 下载量&amp;query=downloads&amp;url=https://api.modrinth.com/v2/project/oUoetxfR&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=2d2d2d\" alt=\"Modrinth 下载量\" /></a></p>\n\n墙面跳跃、二段跳、跨栏跳跃等更多功能\n\n<strong>本模组新增：</strong>\n\n<strong>墙面吸附：</strong>朝墙壁跳跃并按住墙壁跳跃键（LSHIFT）\n\n<strong>墙面跳跃：</strong>在墙面吸附状态下，保持按住 W 键并松开 LSHIFT 键即可进行墙面跳跃\n\n<strong>二段跳：</strong>可选的在空中进行二次跳跃\n\n<strong>速度加成：</strong>在疾跑或使用鞘翅飞行时提升移动速度\n\n<strong>陡坡辅助：</strong>即使在半空中也能走上台阶，还能跳过栅栏\n\n<strong>Fabric/Quilt 依赖：</strong>\n\n- <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\" target=\"_blank\">Mod Menu 模组</a> <strong>（可选）</strong>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/oUoetxfR/images/ccab85538f124c14fc7b772ddaff7c4c4097593a.png\">",
